[[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2892047\">7005M10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892027\">7005C53</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892042\">7005E22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891965\">5570T90</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892045\">7005E38</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892028\">7005C62</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892044\">7005E34</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892041\">7005E10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892006\">7005A04</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolt securing the door check strap to the body.</p><p>2. Remove the seal.</p><p>3. Unscrew the bolts securing the check strap to the door.</p><p>4. Remove the door check strap.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035526.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the check strap\nand seal are not damaged.</p><p>Fit the check strap in its seat.</p><p>Tighten the bolts securing the check strap\nto the door.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>FRONT DOOR OPENING LIMITER</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.8 - 1.2</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Fit the seal.</p><p>Tighten the bolt securing the check strap\nto the body.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>FRONT DOOR OPENING LIMITER</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>2.2 - 2.7</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Lubricate the check strap with the specified\nproduct.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001236.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Type</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Qty.</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Grease</p></td><td><p>FRONT DOOR OPENING LIMITER</p></td><td><p>MR2/CX FIAT</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>-</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2892006\">7005A04</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892041\">7005E10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892044\">7005E34</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892028\">7005C62</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892045\">7005E38</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891965\">5570T90</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892042\">7005E22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892027\">7005C53</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892047\">7005M10</a></p>"]]